<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco, GCC downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco, GCC downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Interacciones brokerage said on Monday it lowered its rating on cement companies Apasco and Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua (GCC).</p>
<p>Apasco was downgraded to accumulate from buy and GCC was lowered to speculative buy from strong buy, analyst Jaime Fernandez told Reuters.</p>
</text>
